  "notes": [
    "Explicit reviewed finishes replace ornamental outer alpha; declared content holes, native dimensions, animation settings and frame order remain.",
    "Report parts use one 580px shared frame; the native 581px pieces keep one transparent alignment column. Mid sections have no horizontal bevels.",
    "Original operative burning-paper animation is semantic artwork and is preserved byte-for-byte after RGBA decoding.",
    "Mission frames retain the native on/off indicator and independent diagonal restricted cue. Frame 1/3 are on, 2/4 off (one-based); do not infer unrelated selection/hover states.",
    "Occupation collapsed card is a full 121px section. Its lower border is a section divider after expansion; extended mid/footer are open on their joining edge."
  ],
